<doc id="172800" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=172800" title="Arroz caldo">
Arroz caldo

Calon Arroz, uga dieja Aroskaldo, minangka &lt;a href="Pantun"&gt;beras&lt;/a&gt; Filipina lan &lt;a href="Pantun"&gt;bahan&lt;/a&gt; bakar daging ayam sing &lt;a href="Jenang%20sungsum"&gt;ditandur&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Ja%C3%A9"&gt;jahe&lt;/a&gt; lan dihiasi &lt;a href="Bawang"&gt;bawang putih&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Loncang"&gt;bawang daun&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Mrica"&gt;mrica ireng&lt;/a&gt;. Biasane &lt;a href="Kalamansi"&gt;disajeni&lt;/a&gt; nganggo &lt;a href="Kalamansi"&gt;calamansi&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="K%C3%A9cap%20iwak"&gt;saos iwak&lt;/a&gt; (patis) minangka &lt;a href="Bumbu%20sisih"&gt;bumbu&lt;/a&gt;, uga &lt;a href="Endhog%20godhog"&gt;endhog rebus&lt;/a&gt;. Umume versi uga nambah safflower (kasubha) sing dadi sajian kuning dadi khas. Arroz caldo uga dikenal minangka pospas ing wilayah Visayan, sanajan pospas duwe bahan sing beda-beda.Calon Arroz kalebu jinis lugaw. Iki dianggep minangka panganan sing nyenengake ing budaya Filipina lan dadi sarapan sing populer.

