<doc id="172811" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=172811" title="Daging cacah">
Daging cacah

A chop meat punika salah sawijining olahan jinis &lt;a href="Daging"&gt;meat&lt;/a&gt; Motong sejajar karo balung geger, lan biasane ngemot &lt;a href="Balung%20iga"&gt;rib&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Iga%20babi"&gt;riblet&lt;/a&gt; bagean vertebra lan njabat minangka bagean individu. Jenis daging sing paling umum yaiku &lt;a href="daging%20babi"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Daging%20domba"&gt;wedhus&lt;/a&gt;. Potong potong tanpa tulang sing tipis, utawa &lt;a href="balung"&gt;balung&lt;/a&gt; iga mung bisa diarani &lt;a href="cutlet"&gt;cutlet&lt;/a&gt;, sanajan bedane ora mesthi jelas. Tembung "chop" biasane ora digunakake kanggo &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt;, nanging steak balung T intine cuping loop, steak iga lan potongan iga.

</doc>
<doc id="172812" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=172812" title="Baba ghanoush">
Baba ghanoush

Baba ghanoush (, ; &lt;a href="Basa%20Arab"&gt;Arab&lt;/a&gt;: بابا غنوج‎, #ALIH ‎), uga dieja baba ganoush utawa baba ghanouj, minangka salah sawijining jinis panganan pembuka Levantine &lt;a href="T%C3%A9rong"&gt;eggplant&lt;/a&gt; masak sing wis dicampur karo &lt;a href="tahini"&gt;tahini&lt;/a&gt; (digawe saka &lt;a href="Wij%C3%A8n"&gt;wiji wijen&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Lenga%20ja%C3%A9tun"&gt;minyak zaitun&lt;/a&gt;, bisa uga &lt;a href="L%C3%A9mon"&gt;jus lemon&lt;/a&gt;, lan macem-macem &lt;a href="Pambumbuan"&gt;bumbu&lt;/a&gt;. Cara tradisional, mutabbal punika &lt;a href="Bumbu%20sisih"&gt;bumbu&lt;/a&gt; aforedescribed lan baba ghanoush luwih kaya salad &lt;a href="Saos%20celupan"&gt;dip&lt;/a&gt; digawe karo molasses pomegranate (utawa pomegranate wiji) lan lenga zaitun, lan asring tanpa tahini. Bisa dicampur karo bawang, tomat, utawa sayuran liyane.
