<doc id="172817" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=172817" title="Zefir">
Zefir

zefir (basa &lt;a href="basa%20Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan&lt;/a&gt;: зефи́р, Uga ditulis zephyr utawa zephir) iku salah sawijining olahan jinis alus ing kitha digawe dening whipping woh lan Semono uga Sindhunata &lt;a href="Pur%C3%A9"&gt;puree&lt;/a&gt; (biasane apple puree) karo gula lan &lt;a href="Putih%20endhog"&gt;endhog tiyang kuilt pethak&lt;/a&gt; karo Kajaba sakteruse saka agen gelling kaya pektin, &lt;a href="Karagenan"&gt;carrageenan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ager-ager"&gt;agar&lt;/a&gt;, utawa &lt;a href="Gelatin"&gt;gelatine&lt;/a&gt;. Iki diproduksi ing negara-negara tilas &lt;a href="Uni%20Sovy%C3%A8t"&gt;Uni Soviet&lt;/a&gt;. Jeneng sing diwenehake sawise dewa Yunani angin kulon cahya &lt;a href="Anemoi"&gt;Zephyr&lt;/a&gt; nglambangake konsistensi hawa sing alus. 
