<doc id="172833" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=172833" title="Recado rojo">
Recado rojo

Recado rojo utawa pasta achiote minangka salah sawijining campuran &lt;a href="Bumbon%20crak%C3%A8n"&gt;rempah&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href="Bumbon%20crak%C3%A8n"&gt;rempah sing&lt;/a&gt; populer. Saiki digandhengake banget karo masakan Meksiko lan Belizean, utamane saka Yucatán lan Oaxaca. Dicampur bumbu biasane kalebu annatto, &lt;a href="Or%C3%A9gano"&gt;oregano&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jinten%20putih"&gt;cumin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Cengk%C3%A8h"&gt;clove&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kayu%20legi"&gt;kayu manis&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mrica"&gt;mrico ireng&lt;/a&gt;, allspice, &lt;a href="Bawang"&gt;papak&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="uyah"&gt;uyah&lt;/a&gt;. Wiji annatto pewarna campuran abang, lan menehi warna abang-oranye khas kanggo panganan kasebut.
