<doc id="172892" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=172892" title="Zeppole">
Zeppole

Zeppola (] ; jamak: zeppole ; kadhangkala disebut frittelle, lan ing &lt;a href="Sardinia"&gt;Sardinia&lt;/a&gt; ing italianized zippole utawa zeppole sarde saka asli Sardinian tzípulas) iku salah sawijining olahan &lt;a href="Olahan%20Itali"&gt;Italia&lt;/a&gt; jajanan dumadi saka &lt;a href="Gor%C3%A8ng%20kungkum"&gt;jero-goreng&lt;/a&gt; keuangan bal saka ukuran werna-werna nanging biasane bab 4 in diameteripun. &lt;a href="Gor%C3%A8ng%20celup"&gt;Fritter&lt;/a&gt; iki biasane &lt;a href="Custard"&gt;diiseni&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Gula%20alus"&gt;gula bubuk&lt;/a&gt;, lan bisa uga diisi karo &lt;a href="custard"&gt;custard&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="S%C3%A9l%C3%A9%20woh"&gt;jelly&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Custard"&gt;krim jajanan&lt;/a&gt; gaya cannoli, utawa campuran &lt;a href="Mert%C3%A9ga"&gt;butter lan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="madu"&gt;madu&lt;/a&gt;. Konsistensi kasebut kalebu saka cahya lan bengkak, nganti &lt;a href="roti"&gt;roti&lt;/a&gt; - utawa kaya &lt;a href="pasta"&gt;pasta&lt;/a&gt;. Mangan kanggo ngrameke Dina Santo Yusuf, yaiku dina riyaya Katolik. 
