<doc id="172901" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=172901" title="Sundae">
Sundae

Sundae () iku sawijining jinis &lt;a href="%C3%88s%20krim"&gt;es krim&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="panganan%20cuci%20mulut"&gt;panganan cuci mulut&lt;/a&gt;. Biasane kalebu siji utawa luwih sendok es krim sing dicampuri saus utawa sirup, lan ing sawetara kasus, topping liyane kaya ta: &lt;a href="M%C3%A8ses"&gt;taburan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="krim%20kocok"&gt;krim kocok&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="marshmallow"&gt;marshmallow&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kacang%20brol"&gt;kacang&lt;/a&gt;, ceri maraschino, utawa &lt;a href="woh"&gt;woh&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href="woh"&gt;woh&lt;/a&gt;an liyane (kaya ta &lt;a href="Gedhang"&gt;pisang&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="nanas"&gt;nanas&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Gedhang%20pisah"&gt;pisang pisang&lt;/a&gt;). Iki disajekake nalika anyep.

