Crema de fruta

Crema de fruta yaiku salah sawijining olahan panganan tradisional Filipino fruitcake digawe karo lapisan saka &lt;a href="Kuw%C3%A9%20spons"&gt;karang jajan&lt;/a&gt;, manis &lt;a href="Custard"&gt;puding&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Krim%20kocok"&gt;krim&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="gelatin"&gt;gelatin&lt;/a&gt; utawa gulaman (&lt;a href="Ager-ager"&gt;ager&lt;/a&gt;), lan macem-macem wadi utawa seger woh-wohan, kalebu &lt;a href="Pelem"&gt;mangoes&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Nanas"&gt;pineapples&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="C%C3%A9ri"&gt;cherries&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Setrob%C3%A9ri"&gt;strawberries&lt;/a&gt;. Biasane disedhiyakake sajrone musim Natal. Iki duwe macem-macem variasi, mulai saka owah-owahan ing woh-wohan sing digunakake nganti tambahan bahan kayata &lt;a href="S%C3%A9l%C3%A9%20woh"&gt;senggol&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="sagu"&gt;sagu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Susu%20kondensasi"&gt;susu kental&lt;/a&gt;, lan liya-liyane. 
