<doc id="172915" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=172915" title="Tourtière">
Tourtière

Tourtière (], [tuʁt͡sjaɛ̯ʁ]) minangka salah sawijining olahan jinis &lt;a href="Pai%20daging"&gt;pie daging&lt;/a&gt; Kanada sing asale saka &lt;a href="Daftar%20provinsi%20lan%20teritori%20Kanada"&gt;provinsi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Quebec"&gt;Quebec&lt;/a&gt;, biasane digawe daging &lt;a href="Daging%20babi"&gt;babi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Daging%20sapi%20enom"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt; lan kentang cincang. Game liar kadang digunakake. Bagéan tradhisional kanggo réveillon Natal lan mangan ing Taun Anyar ing &lt;a href="Quebec"&gt;Quebec&lt;/a&gt;, iki uga misuwur ing New Brunswick, lan didol ing toko kelontong ing saindenging &lt;a href="Kanadhah"&gt;Kanada&lt;/a&gt;, suwene taun suwene.

