<doc id="172974" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=172974" title="Crempog">
Crempog

Crempog (jamak: crempogau) yaiku salah sawijining jinis panganan &lt;a href="Kuw%C3%A9%20dhadhar"&gt;pancake&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Wales"&gt;Welsh sing&lt;/a&gt; digawe &lt;a href="glepung"&gt;glepung&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Susu%20mert%C3%A9ga"&gt;buttermilk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Endhog%20minangka%20panganan"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="cuka"&gt;cuka&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Mert%C3%A9ga"&gt;butter&lt;/a&gt; asin. Cara tradisional digawe ing bakestones utawa griddles, crempog minangka salah sawijining resep paling tuwa ing Wales. Dheweke uga dikenal minangka ffroes, pancos lan cramoth lan biasane disajekake kanthi tumpuk menyang tumpukan lan disebar karo butter. &lt;a href="Tradhisi"&gt;Biasane&lt;/a&gt; dianakake ing perayaan ing Wales, kayata dina Selasa Shrove lan ulang taun.

