<doc id="172989" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=172989" title="Kuwé dadar bayi Walanda">
Kuwé dadar bayi Walanda

Bayi pancake Walanda (utawa bayi Walanda), kadang diarani pancake Jerman, Bismarck, utawa puff Walanda, yaiku &lt;a href="popover"&gt;popover&lt;/a&gt; Amerika sing gedhe. 
Bayi Walanda mirip karo &lt;a href="Puding%20Yorkshire"&gt;puding Yorkshire sing&lt;/a&gt; gedhe. Dibandhingake karo &lt;a href="Kuw%C3%A9%20dhadhar"&gt;pancake&lt;/a&gt; khas, bayi Walanda mesthi dipanggang ing oven, tinimbang digoreng ing loro-lorone ing ndhuwur kompor, umume luwih kenthel tinimbang umume pancake, lan ora ana &lt;a href="Agen%20ragi"&gt;bahan-&lt;/a&gt; bahan &lt;a href="Agen%20ragi"&gt;ragi kimia&lt;/a&gt;, kayata &lt;a href="Bubuk%20panggang"&gt;bubuk manggang&lt;/a&gt;.
Gagasan pancake bayi Walanda bisa uga asalé saka &lt;a href="Kuw%C3%A9%20dhadhar"&gt;Pfannkuchen&lt;/a&gt; Jerman, nanging bentuk saiki diwiwiti ing AS ing wiwitan taun 1900an. 
Digawe nganggo &lt;a href="Endhog%20minangka%20panganan"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Glepung%20gandum"&gt;glepung&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="gula"&gt;gula&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="susu"&gt;susu&lt;/a&gt;, lan biasane dibumboni &lt;a href="Panili"&gt;vanilla&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Kayu%20legi"&gt;kayu manis&lt;/a&gt;, sanajan kadhang kala ditambahake woh-wohan utawa rasa liyane. Adonan dhasar ngemot saprotelon gelas tepung lan saprotelon gelas susu saben endhog.
