Palatschinke

Palatschinke (utawa palaccinka, jamak palatschinke) punika salah sawijining olahan lancip &lt;a href="Cr%C3%AApe"&gt;Pancake&lt;/a&gt; -like macem-macem &lt;a href="Kuw%C3%A9%20dhadhar"&gt;pancake&lt;/a&gt; saka Greco-Romawi asal. Nalika &lt;a href="panganan%20cuci%20mulut"&gt;panganan cuci mulut&lt;/a&gt; paling umum ing negara-negara Slavia Selatan lan Kulon, umume uga dikenal ing bagean liyane ing &lt;a href="%C3%89ropa%20W%C3%A9tan"&gt;Eropa&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="%C3%89ropa%20Tengah"&gt;Tengah&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="%C3%89ropa%20W%C3%A9tan"&gt;Timur&lt;/a&gt;. Jeneng sajian kalebu Palaçinka (&lt;a href="Basa%20Albania"&gt;Albania&lt;/a&gt;), Palatschinke (pl. Palatschinken) (Jerman Jerman), palačinka (pl. Palačinke) (&lt;a href="Basa%20Bosni"&gt;Bosnia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Basa%20Kroasia"&gt;Kroasia&lt;/a&gt;, Slovene), palacinka (&lt;a href="Basa%20Slowak"&gt;Slowak&lt;/a&gt;), palačinka (&lt;a href="Basa%20C%C3%A9ko"&gt;Czech&lt;/a&gt;), палачинка (&lt;a href="Basa%20Bulgari"&gt;Bulgaria&lt;/a&gt;, Montenegrin, Macedonian, &lt;a href="Basa%20S%C3%A8rbi"&gt;Serbia&lt;/a&gt;), naleśnik (&lt;a href="Basa%20Polen"&gt;Polen&lt;/a&gt;), cliteit (&lt;a href="Basa%20Rumania"&gt;Romania&lt;/a&gt;), palacinta utawa palacinca (&lt;a href="Basa%20Itali"&gt;Italia&lt;/a&gt;) lan palacsinta (&lt;a href="Basa%20Honggari"&gt;Hungaria&lt;/a&gt;).
