<doc id="173060" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=173060" title="Avgolemono">
Avgolemono

Avgolemono, avgolémono (&lt;a href="Basa%20Grikenlan"&gt;Grikenlan&lt;/a&gt;: αυγολέμονο utawa αβγολέμονο) utawa sauce endhog-linglang, iku salah siji suku &lt;a href="Saos"&gt;sauces&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Sop"&gt;soups&lt;/a&gt; digawe karo &lt;a href="Endhog%20minangka%20panganan"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Kuning%20endhog"&gt;yolk&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="L%C3%A9mon"&gt;linglang&lt;/a&gt; jus &lt;a href="Duduh%20kaldhu"&gt;duduh kaldu&lt;/a&gt;, digawe panas nganti padha thicken. Kasedhiya ing masakan Yunani, Turki, Arab, Yahudi Sephardik, Balkan, lan &lt;a href="Olahan%20Itali"&gt;Italia&lt;/a&gt;. 
Ing &lt;a href="Masakan%20Yahudi%20sephardic"&gt;masakan Yahudi Sephardic&lt;/a&gt;, diarani agristada utawa salsa blanco, lan ing &lt;a href="Olahan%20Itali"&gt;masakan Italia&lt;/a&gt;, bagna brusca, brodettato, utawa brodo brusco. Ing &lt;a href="basa%20Arab"&gt;basa Arab&lt;/a&gt;, diarani tarbiya utawa beida bi-lemoune 'endhog nganggo jeruk nipis '; lan ing terbiye &lt;a href="Basa%20Turki"&gt;Turki&lt;/a&gt;. Uga digunakake ing &lt;a href="masakan%20Balkan"&gt;masakan Balkan&lt;/a&gt;. 
