<doc id="173066" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=173066" title="Saos bolognese">
Saos bolognese

Saus bolognese (, ; dikenal ing &lt;a href="Basa%20Itali"&gt;basa Italia&lt;/a&gt; minangka ragù alla bolognese,], ragù bolognese, utawa mung &lt;a href="rag%C3%B9"&gt;ragù&lt;/a&gt;) minangka &lt;a href="Saos"&gt;saus&lt;/a&gt; adhedhasar daging ing &lt;a href="Olahan%20Itali"&gt;masakan Italia&lt;/a&gt;, khas kutha &lt;a href="Bologna"&gt;Bologna&lt;/a&gt;. Biasane digunakake kanggo macak &lt;a href="tagliatelle"&gt;tagliatelle&lt;/a&gt; al &lt;a href="rag%C3%B9"&gt;ragù&lt;/a&gt; lan nyiyapake &lt;a href="Lasagna"&gt;lasagne&lt;/a&gt; alla bolognese.
Ragual all bolognese asli yaiku saus adhedhasar daging sing dimasak alon-alon, lan &lt;a href="Kangkung%20Cah%20Terasi"&gt;persiyapane&lt;/a&gt; kalebu sawetara teknik, kalebu &lt;a href="Kringet%20%28masak%29"&gt;kringet&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kangkung%20Cah%20Terasi"&gt;tumis&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Nggodhog"&gt;gelisah&lt;/a&gt;. Bahan kalebu &lt;a href="soffritto"&gt;soffritto&lt;/a&gt; karakteristik bawang, celery lan wortel, macem-macem jinis daging &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;sapi sing&lt;/a&gt; dicincang utawa dicincang kanthi apik, asring ditambah &lt;a href="daging%20babi"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt; lemu sing &lt;a href="Daging%20babi"&gt;sithik&lt;/a&gt;. Anggur putih, susu, lan sawetara &lt;a href="Tempel%20tomat"&gt;pasta&lt;/a&gt; tomat utawa tomat ditambahake, lan sajian banjur &lt;a href="Mendhem"&gt;didhem&lt;/a&gt; nganti dawa kanggo ngasilake saos sing kenthel. 
