<doc id="173069" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=173069" title="Loco moco">
Loco moco

Loco moco minangka salah sawijining olahan sing ditampilake ing masakan kontemporer Hawaii. Ana macem-macem variasi, nanging moco lokal loko kalebu nasi putih, paling ndhuwur karo &lt;a href="hamburger"&gt;hamburger&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Endhog%20minangka%20panganan"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt; goreng, lan &lt;a href="Duduh%20kenthel"&gt;kuah&lt;/a&gt; coklat. Variasi bisa uga kalebu &lt;a href="Daging%20bakon"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="ham"&gt;ham&lt;/a&gt;, Spam, &lt;a href="tahu"&gt;tahu&lt;/a&gt;, daging babi kalua, &lt;a href="Lingui%C3%A7a"&gt;sosis Portugis&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Teriyaki"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Teriyaki"&gt;teriyaki, pitik teriyaki&lt;/a&gt;, mahi-mahi, urang, tiram, lan &lt;a href="daging"&gt;daging&lt;/a&gt; liyane.

