Khao mu daeng

Khao mu daeng (#ALIH,], surem.: 'beras abang-daging babi') iku salah sawijining olahan &lt;a href="Masakan%20Thailand"&gt;Thai sajian&lt;/a&gt;, varian lokal &lt;a href="Char%20siu"&gt;char Siew&lt;/a&gt; karo beras (Chinese, &lt;a href="Hanyu%20Pinyin"&gt;pinyin&lt;/a&gt;: chā shāo fàn) &lt;a href="Masakan%20Cinten"&gt;masakan Cina&lt;/a&gt;. 
