Minestrone

Minestrone (,]) minangka &lt;a href="Sop"&gt;sawijining olahan sup&lt;/a&gt; kenthel sing asale saka &lt;a href="Itali"&gt;Italia sing&lt;/a&gt; digawe &lt;a href="Janganan"&gt;sayuran&lt;/a&gt;, asring ditambah &lt;a href="pasta"&gt;pasta&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Pantun"&gt;nasi&lt;/a&gt;, kadhang kalorone. Bahan-bahan umum kalebu kacang, &lt;a href="Bawang%20bombay"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sl%C3%A8dri"&gt;celery&lt;/a&gt;, wortel, stok, lan &lt;a href="tomat"&gt;tomat&lt;/a&gt;.

