Mulligatawny

Mulligatawny [ˈmɐlɨɡəˈtɑːni] &lt;a href="null"&gt;pra=|Babagan swara iki&lt;/a&gt; yaiku salah sawijining olahan &lt;a href="Sop"&gt;sup&lt;/a&gt; sing asale saka masakan India Selatan. Jeneng kasebut asale saka tembung &lt;a href="Basa%20Tamil"&gt;Tamil&lt;/a&gt; miḷagāy (Tamil: 'lombok') utawa miḷagu (மிளகு 'mrico'), lan taṇṇi (தண்ணி, 'banyu'). &lt;a href="Rasam"&gt;Gegayutan karo rasam&lt;/a&gt; sajian.
