<doc id="173142" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=173142" title="Stracciatella">
Stracciatella

Stracciatella (] ; ing &lt;a href="Basa%20Itali"&gt;basa Italia&lt;/a&gt;, yaiku￼￼panganan￼￼ salah sawijining diminutive sing asale saka tembung kriya stracciare ("to shred"), sing artine "a little shred"), uga dikenal minangka Stracciatella alla romana, yaiku &lt;a href="Sop"&gt;sup&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Itali"&gt;Italia sing kalebu&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Duduh%20kaldhu"&gt;duduh kaldu&lt;/a&gt; daging lan potongan cilik saka campuran adhedhasar &lt;a href="endhog"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt;, disiapake kanthi nyampur campuran menyang duduh kaldu sing wis umob lan diudak.Iki misuwur ana ing sekitar &lt;a href="Roma"&gt;Roma&lt;/a&gt; ing tlatah &lt;a href="Latium"&gt;Lazio&lt;/a&gt;, Italia tengah. Sup sing padha, sing diarani zanzarelli, diterangake dening Martino da Como ing buku manual abad kaping 15, The Art of Cooking. Varian liya ana.

