<doc id="173144" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=173144" title="Pyttipanna">
Pyttipanna

Pyttipanna, uga pytt i panne, pytt i panne (&lt;a href="Basa%20Nurw%C3%A8gen"&gt;Nurwègen&lt;/a&gt;), pyttipannu (&lt;a href="Basa%20Suomi"&gt;Finnish&lt;/a&gt;), minangka panganan kuliner sing kalebu daging cincang, kentang, lan bawang sing digoreng, padha karo &lt;a href="hash"&gt;hash&lt;/a&gt;. Tembung iki &lt;a href="Basa%20Sw%C3%A8dhen"&gt;Swèdhen&lt;/a&gt; kanggo "potongan cilik ing wajan". Iki minangka sajian sing populer ing &lt;a href="Sw%C3%A8dhen"&gt;Swèdhen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Nurw%C3%A8gen"&gt;Nurwègen&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Finlan"&gt;Finlan&lt;/a&gt;, lan ing &lt;a href="Dh%C3%A8nemarken"&gt;Dhènemarken&lt;/a&gt;, sing jeneng kasebut biksemad, kanthi harfiah tegese "panganan campuran".
Cara tradisional dumadi saka &lt;a href="Kenthang"&gt;kentang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bawang%20bombay"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt;, lan sembarang jenis disigar utawa &lt;a href="Daging%20giling"&gt;minced&lt;/a&gt; meat kayata &lt;a href="sosis"&gt;sosis&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ham"&gt;Ham&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Daging%20glindhing"&gt;meatballs&lt;/a&gt;, diced lan banjur digoreng, asring dadi karo &lt;a href="Endhog%20gor%C3%A8ng"&gt;endhog goreng&lt;/a&gt;, pickled &lt;a href="beetroot"&gt;beetroot&lt;/a&gt; irisan-irisan, ora nguntungke pickled &lt;a href="gherkin"&gt;gherkin&lt;/a&gt; irisan-irisan, &lt;a href="capers"&gt;capers&lt;/a&gt; lan kadhangkala &lt;a href="saos%20tomat"&gt;saos tomat&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Saos%20coklat"&gt;saus coklat&lt;/a&gt;. Piring kasebut asale digawe saka &lt;a href="turahan"&gt;turahan&lt;/a&gt; panganan sing kepungkur nanging saiki umume umume nyiyapake pyttipanna saka bahan-bahan utama. Pyttipanna beku saka macem-macem jinis bisa tuku ing meh kabeh supermarket Swèdhen, Dhènemarken, Nurwègen lan Finlan. Akeh jinis panganan sing ana, kalebu panganan &lt;a href="vegetarian"&gt;vegetarian&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="vegan"&gt;vegan&lt;/a&gt;.
