A adhem, dodo es hotspot, kothak es, kothak kelangan, chilly bin (ing &lt;a href="Niu%20S%C3%A9lan"&gt;New Zealand&lt;/a&gt;), utawa esky (&lt;a href="Ostrali"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt;) iku sawijining terisolasi kothak digunakake kanggo nyimpen pangan utawa ngombe sing kelangan.
