<doc id="173248" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=173248" title="Torshi">
Torshi

Torshi (Aram ܡܟ̇ܠܠ,: &lt;a href="Basa%20Arab"&gt;Arab&lt;/a&gt;: مخلل mukhallal, &lt;a href="Basa%20P%C3%A8rsi"&gt;Persia&lt;/a&gt;: ترشى torshi ; &lt;a href="Basa%20Kurdhi"&gt;Kurdi&lt;/a&gt;: ترشى Tirşîn, tirşî, trshin ; &lt;a href="basa%20Basa%20Turki"&gt;Basa Turki&lt;/a&gt;: turşu ; &lt;a href="Basa%20Grikenlan"&gt;Grikenlan&lt;/a&gt;: τουρσί turis ; &lt;a href="Basa%20Bulgari"&gt;Bulgari&lt;/a&gt;: туршия turshiya ; &lt;a href="Basa%20Bosni"&gt;Bosnia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Basa%20Kroasia"&gt;Kroasia&lt;/a&gt;, Montenegrin, &lt;a href="Basa%20S%C3%A8rbi"&gt;Serbia&lt;/a&gt;: turšija / туршија ; &lt;a href="Basa%20Albania"&gt;Albania&lt;/a&gt;: turshi &lt;a href="Basa%20Ibrani"&gt;Ibrani&lt;/a&gt;: חמ, khamutsim; Macedonian: туршија) sing &lt;a href="Pangaseman"&gt;pickled&lt;/a&gt; sayuran masakan saka akeh &lt;a href="Balkan"&gt;Balkan&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="W%C3%A9tan%20Tengah"&gt;Timur Tengah&lt;/a&gt; negara. Tembung torshi pungkasane asale saka basa Persia torsh, sing tegese 'asem'. Ing &lt;a href="Kulawarga%20basa%20Turk"&gt;basa Turki&lt;/a&gt; kayata Turki lan Azerbaijan diarani Ejaan turşu.
Torshi umume digunakake ing macem-macem &lt;a href="masakan%20Timur%20Tengah"&gt;masakan Timur Tengah&lt;/a&gt; kayata &lt;a href="Masakan%20Arab"&gt;masakan Arab, masakan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Masakan%20Turki"&gt;Turki&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="masakan%20Iran"&gt;masakan Iran&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Iran"&gt;Iran&lt;/a&gt; duwe variasi atusan macem-macem jinis torshi miturut adat daerah lan acara liyane. Ing sawetara kulawarga, ora ana panganan sing dianggep lengkap tanpa mangkuk torshi ing meja. Ing &lt;a href="masakan%20Bulgaria"&gt;masakan Bulgaria&lt;/a&gt;, jinis sing paling populer yaiku tsarska turshiya ("acar raja") lan selska turshiya ("acar negara"). Toursi minangka panganan pembuka tradisional (&lt;a href="meze"&gt;meze&lt;/a&gt;) kanggo &lt;a href="Arak%20%28ngombe%29"&gt;arak&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="rak%C4%B1"&gt;rakı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="ouzo"&gt;ouzo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="tsipouro"&gt;tsipouro&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="rakia"&gt;rakia&lt;/a&gt;. Ing sawetara wilayah, banyu torshi (turşu suyu) uga bisa diminum lan misuwur banget ing &lt;a href="Turki"&gt;Turki&lt;/a&gt;.

