<doc id="173328" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=173328" title="Mi kocok">
Mi kocok

Mie kocok (surem: "shaken mie"), iku sawijining &lt;a href="Masakan%20Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonesia&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Sop%20mi"&gt;sup mie&lt;/a&gt;, beluk saka &lt;a href="Kutha%20Bandhung"&gt;Bandung&lt;/a&gt; kutha, &lt;a href="Jawa%20Kulon"&gt;Jawa Barat&lt;/a&gt;. Sajian iki kasusun saka mie dadi ing sugih sup daging sapi consommé, kikil (daging sapi tendon), sprouts kacang lan &lt;a href="bakso"&gt;bakso&lt;/a&gt; (daging sapi bakso), &lt;a href="Jeruk%20purut"&gt;kaffir jeruk&lt;/a&gt; jus, lan sprinkled karo ngiris seger &lt;a href="Sl%C3%A8dri"&gt;celery&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Loncang"&gt;scallion&lt;/a&gt; lan goreng &lt;a href="Brambang"&gt;shallot&lt;/a&gt;. Sawetara resep bisa uga nambah tripe daging sapi. 
Ing basa &lt;a href="Basa%20Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonesia&lt;/a&gt; istilah kocok tegese "goyang", lan nuduhake metode lelembut lan masak mi kanthi goyang mie sing dilebokake ing wadhah timah keropos sing ditangani, nalika disiram ing banyu panas. Piring kasebut nggunakake mie kuning sing rata. Kanggo nambah rasa lan spiciness tembung &lt;a href="K%C3%A9cap%20legi"&gt;manis&lt;/a&gt; (kecap manis) lan &lt;a href="Sambel"&gt;sambal&lt;/a&gt; bisa uga ditambahake. Piring mie sing jenenge padha nanging rada beda saka kutha tanggane &lt;a href="Kutha%20Cirebon"&gt;Cirebon&lt;/a&gt; diarani &lt;a href="Mi%20koclok"&gt;mie koclok&lt;/a&gt;.
