<doc id="173355" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=173355" title="Whey">
Whey

Whey minangka cairan sing isih ana sawise &lt;a href="susu"&gt;susu&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Curd"&gt;digulung&lt;/a&gt; lan disaring. Iki minangka produk sampingan saka pabrik &lt;a href="K%C3%A8ju"&gt;keju&lt;/a&gt; utawa kasein lan duwe sawetara kagunan komersial. Whey manis minangka produk sampingan sing digawe saka jinis keju rennet, kaya ta keju cheddar utawa &lt;a href="K%C3%A8ju%20%C3%A8mmental"&gt;Switserlan&lt;/a&gt;. Asam whey (uga dikenal minangka asam asam) minangka produk sampingan sing digawe nalika nggawe jinis asam produk susu, kaya ta keju pondok utawa yogurt saring. Protein whey minangka kumpulan &lt;a href="Protein%20globular"&gt;protein globular sing&lt;/a&gt; diisolasi saka whey. Protein ing susu sapi yaiku 20% protein whey lan 80% protein kasein, dene protein ing susu manungsa 70% whey lan 30% casein. Fraksi protein ing whey kalebu udakara 10% saka total padatan garing ing whey. Protein iki biasane campuran &lt;a href="beta-lactoglobulin"&gt;beta-lactoglobulin&lt;/a&gt; (~ 65%), &lt;a href="Alfa-laktalbumin"&gt;alpha-lactalbumin&lt;/a&gt; (~ 25%), &lt;a href="albumin%20serum%20sapi"&gt;albumin serum sapi&lt;/a&gt; (~ 8%) (pirsani uga &lt;a href="albumin%20serum"&gt;albumin serum&lt;/a&gt;), lan &lt;a href="Antibodi"&gt;immunoglobulin&lt;/a&gt;. Iki larut ing bentuk asale, ora gumantung karo pH.
