<doc id="173363" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=173363" title="Kukis kismis oatmeal">
Kukis kismis oatmeal

Cookie kismis oatmeal minangka jinis &lt;a href="Kukis"&gt;cookie drop sing&lt;/a&gt; dibedakake karo adonan adhedhasar &lt;a href="oatmeal"&gt;oatmeal&lt;/a&gt; kanthi &lt;a href="Kismis"&gt;kismis sing&lt;/a&gt; dicampur. Bahan-bahane biasane kalebu &lt;a href="glepung"&gt;glepung&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="gula"&gt;gula&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Endhog%20minangka%20panganan"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="uyah"&gt;uyah&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Bumbon%20crak%C3%A8n"&gt;rempah-rempah liyane&lt;/a&gt;. Keturunan saka &lt;a href="Kuw%C3%A9%20oat"&gt;oatcake&lt;/a&gt; Skotlandia, cookie kismis oatmeal wis dadi salah sawijining cookie sing paling populer ing Amerika Serikat. Nalika cookie dadi misuwur ing Amerika Serikat ing wiwitan taun 1900-an, cookie kasebut dikenal minangka " panganan kesehatan " amarga nambah kandungan serat lan vitamin saka gandum lan kismis. Nanging, nilai nutrisi cookie kismis oatmeal meh padha karo &lt;a href="Kukis%20kripik%20soklat"&gt;cookie chip coklat&lt;/a&gt;, lan masing-masing duwe isi gula, lemak, kalori lan serat sing padha. 
