Pepito

Pepito yaiku &lt;a href="Sandwich"&gt;sandwich sing&lt;/a&gt; disiapake minangka daging sapi, daging babi, utawa &lt;a href="sandwich"&gt;sandwich&lt;/a&gt; pitik, asale saka &lt;a href="Sepanyol"&gt;Spanyol&lt;/a&gt; lan uga populer ing &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Latin"&gt;Amerika Latin&lt;/a&gt;. Iki minangka &lt;a href="Panganan%20pinggir%20dalan"&gt;panganan&lt;/a&gt; umum ing &lt;a href="Panganan%20pinggir%20dalan"&gt;dalan&lt;/a&gt; ing Venezuela lan uga kasedhiya ing sawetara restoran ing AS. Pepito kadhang kala diarani jinis sandwich &lt;a href="torta"&gt;torta&lt;/a&gt;, lan diarani "torta Meksiko tradisional". Kanggo versi daging sapi, macem-macem potongan daging sapi digunakake, lan bahan tambahan sing akeh uga bisa digunakake nalika nyiyapake. Pepito disiyapake nganggo &lt;a href="tenderloin%20daging%20sapi"&gt;tenderloin daging sapi&lt;/a&gt; panggang, &lt;a href="Steak%20flank"&gt;steak&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Tenderloin%20daging%20sapi"&gt;flap&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Steak%20flank"&gt;steak&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Steak%20mripat%20rib"&gt;eye rib&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Steak%20mripat%20rib"&gt;steak&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Strip%20steak"&gt;strip&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kacang%20buncis%20refried"&gt;kacang-kacangan refried, kacang&lt;/a&gt; ireng utawa kacang pinto, lan gulung empuk, bun utawa baguette minangka bahan utama. &lt;a href="Iwak%20pitik"&gt;Daging ayam&lt;/a&gt; uga asring digunakake. 
