<doc id="173445" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=173445" title="Think Think lan Ah Tsai">
Think Think lan Ah Tsai

Think Think (Chinese) lan Ah Tsai (阿才;) minangka loro kucing kagungane Presiden Taiwan, Tsai Ing-wen. Think Think minangka tapik abu-abu wanita, dene Ah Tsai yaiku jahe, lan lanang. Tsai Ing-wen minangka salah sawijining wanita pisanan sing dipilih kanggo pimpinan negara Asia tanpa teka saka dinasti politik, lan sing pertama sing kanthi resmi mrentah negara sing nganggo basa Tionghoa wiwit Maharani Wu Zetian ing abad kaping wolu. Think Think diadopsi dening Tsai ing taun 2012, sawise digawa dadi bocah cilik sing ora duwe omah dening &lt;a href="Yuan%20Legislatif"&gt;legislator&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Partai%20Progresif%20Demokrat"&gt;Partai Progresif Demokrat&lt;/a&gt; (DPP) &lt;a href="Hsiao%20Bi-khim"&gt;Hsiao Bi-khim&lt;/a&gt;. Hsiao nemokake bocah kasebut ing dalan sing lemu ing stasiun sepur cedhak &lt;a href="Kutha%20Hualien"&gt;Hualien&lt;/a&gt; sawise &lt;a href="Topan%20Saola%20%282012%29"&gt;Topan Saola&lt;/a&gt;. Ah Tsai (tegese 'bakat') minangka kucing tani, lan hadiah saka kanca nalika kampanye presiden Tsai. Kucing kasebut ditemokake ing sacedhake lapangan nanas ing &lt;a href="Kabupaten%20Taitung"&gt;Kabupaten Taitung,&lt;/a&gt; Taiwan sisih wetan. 
