<doc id="173450" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=173450" title="Sosis bologna">
Sosis bologna

Sosis Bologna, uga disebut baloney () utawa parizer, punika &lt;a href="sosis"&gt;sosis&lt;/a&gt; asalé saka &lt;a href="mortadella"&gt;mortadella&lt;/a&gt;, a, sacoro apik daging babi sosis padha-looking lemah ngemot persagi lemak daging babi, Originally saka kutha Italia saka &lt;a href="Bologna"&gt;Bologna&lt;/a&gt; (]&lt;a href="null"&gt;pra=|Babagan swara iki&lt;/a&gt;). Jeneng umum liyane kalebu poloni ing Zimbabwe, Zambia lan Afrika Selatan, devon ing umume negara-negara Australia, lan fritz ing Australia Selatan. Seasoning Khas bologna kalebu &lt;a href="Mrica"&gt;mrico ireng&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pala"&gt;nutmeg&lt;/a&gt;, allspice, &lt;a href="Sl%C3%A8dri"&gt;wiji celery&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Ketumbar"&gt;katumbah&lt;/a&gt; lan, kaya mortadella, Myrtle woh wohan beri dipun roso khusu. Aturan pamrentah AS mrentah supaya bologna Amerika digiling kanthi alus lan tanpa lemak sing katon. Kajaba &lt;a href="daging%20babi"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt;, bologna bisa digawe saka &lt;a href="Iwak%20pitik"&gt;pitik&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Iwak%20kalkun"&gt;kalkun&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt;, daging rusa, kombinasi utawa protein kedele. Kasedhiya macem-macem versi bologna vegetarian lan vegan. Resep khas Inggris nggunakake &lt;a href="Protein%20gandum"&gt;protein&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Dhel%C3%A9"&gt;kedelai&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Protein%20gandum"&gt;gandum&lt;/a&gt; ing panggonan daging tanpa ramping lan minyak sawit tinimbang lemak bebarengan karo pati, &lt;a href="Karagenan"&gt;carrageenan&lt;/a&gt;, lan rasa. Bisa dipangan adhem utawa dimasak kanthi cara sing padha karo bologna tradisional.
