Brisket

Balung sikil iku panganan populer saka &lt;a href="Nggodhog"&gt;Lion&lt;/a&gt; daging sapi &lt;a href="Brisk%C3%A9t"&gt;balung sikil&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Olah-olahan%20Yahudi"&gt;Ashkenazic masakan Yahudi&lt;/a&gt;. Brisket umume digunakake kanggo &lt;a href="Shabbat"&gt;Shabbat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Rosh%20Hashanah"&gt;Rosh Hashanah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Paskah"&gt;Paskah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Riyaya%20Pentahbisan"&gt;Hanukkah&lt;/a&gt;, lan preinan &lt;a href="Pr%C3%A9inan%20Yahudi"&gt;Yahudi&lt;/a&gt; liyane ing komunitas &lt;a href="Ashkenazi%20Yahudi"&gt;Yahudi Ashkenazi&lt;/a&gt;. Umume ditemokake ing komunitas &lt;a href="Yahudi"&gt;Yahudi&lt;/a&gt; ing saindenging &lt;a href="Kanada%20Kanada"&gt;Amerika&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Wong%20Amerika%20Amerika"&gt;Utara&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Isra%C3%A8l"&gt;Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Yahudi%20ing%20Eropa"&gt;Eropa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Yahudi%20Afrika%20Selatan"&gt;Afrika Selatan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Yahudi%20Australia"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt;, Asia lan liya-liyane.

