<doc id="173484" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=173484" title="Pai daging (Australia lan New Zealand)">
Pai daging (Australia lan New Zealand)

Australia utawa New Zealand daging pie punika tangan-ukuran &lt;a href="Pai%20daging"&gt;pie meat&lt;/a&gt; ngemot diced utawa &lt;a href="Daging%20sapi%20ing%20lemah"&gt;meat minced&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Duduh%20kenthel"&gt;saos&lt;/a&gt;, kadang karo trikatuka, jamur, utawa keju lan asring migunakaken minangka &lt;a href="Mbukak-metu"&gt;takeaway&lt;/a&gt; cemilan pangan.
Pai daging dianggep apik ing &lt;a href="Ostrali"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Niu%20S%C3%A9lan"&gt;Selandia Baru&lt;/a&gt;. Iki diterangake dening mantan Perdana Menteri &lt;a href="New%20South%20Wales"&gt;New South Wales&lt;/a&gt; Bob Carr ing taun 2003 minangka " sajian nasional " Australia. Wong Selandia Anyar nganggep pie daging minangka bagean saka masakan New Zealand, lan dadi bagean identitas nasional Selandia Baru. 
