Kuwé johnny

Johnnycake (uga disebut cake lelampahan, roti Johnny, hoecake, cake shawnee utawa Spider cornbread) punika &lt;a href="S%C3%A9real%20jagung"&gt;cornmeal&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Roti%20rata"&gt;flatbread&lt;/a&gt;. Panganan utama Amerika, disiapake ing pesisir Atlantik saka Newfoundland nganti &lt;a href="Jamaika"&gt;Jamaika&lt;/a&gt;. Panganan kasebut asale saka masarakat pribumi ing Amerika Utara. Iki isih dipangan ing Hindia Kulon, &lt;a href="R%C3%A9publik%20Dominika"&gt;Republik Dominika&lt;/a&gt;, Saint Croix, &lt;a href="Bahama"&gt;Bahama&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kolombia"&gt;Kolombia&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Bermuda"&gt;Bermuda&lt;/a&gt; uga ing &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amerika Serikat&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Kanadhah"&gt;Kanada&lt;/a&gt;. Johnnycake modern ditemokake ing &lt;a href="Masakan%20ing%20New%20England"&gt;masakan New England&lt;/a&gt;, lan asring diklaim asale ing &lt;a href="Rhode%20Island"&gt;Pulo Rhode&lt;/a&gt;. A johnnycake modern goreng &lt;a href="S%C3%A9real%20jagung"&gt;cornmeal&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Jenang%20sungsum"&gt;gruel&lt;/a&gt;, kang digawe saka cornmeal kuning utawa putih dicampur karo uyah lan banyu panas utawa susu, lan kadhangkala legi. Ing &lt;a href="Amerika%20Serikat%20Kidul"&gt;Amerika Serikat Kidul&lt;/a&gt;, istilah sing digunakake yaiku hoecake, sanajan iki uga bisa nuduhake roti jagung sing digoreng ing wajan.
