Bir asap (basa &lt;a href="basa%20Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt;: Rauchbier) yaiku salah sawijining jinis &lt;a href="bir"&gt;bir&lt;/a&gt; kanthi rasa &lt;a href="Pangasepan"&gt;asap&lt;/a&gt; khas sing diwenehake kanthi nggunakake &lt;a href="Jawawut"&gt;barley&lt;/a&gt; malt garing ing geni sing mbukak. Rauchbiers of Bamberg ing Jerman, utamane Schlenkerla, minangka bir asap sing paling terkenal.
