Ing &lt;a href="Ngolah%20panganan"&gt;pangan&lt;/a&gt;, brine wis nambani pangan karo &lt;a href="brine"&gt;brine&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Uyah%20kosher"&gt;uyah coarse&lt;/a&gt; kang &lt;a href="Pangawetan%20panganan"&gt;ngreksa&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Pambumbuan"&gt;mangsa&lt;/a&gt; pangan nalika nambahi &lt;a href="Lelembut%20daging"&gt;tenderness&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Rasa"&gt;roso&lt;/a&gt; karo tambahan kaya ta &lt;a href="Herba"&gt;Jamu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bumbon%20crak%C3%A8n"&gt;rempah-rempah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="gula"&gt;gula&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Karam%C3%A8l"&gt;caramel&lt;/a&gt; lan / utawa &lt;a href="cuka"&gt;cuka&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Daging"&gt;Daging&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="iwak"&gt;iwak&lt;/a&gt; biasane dikonsumsi kurang saka rong puluh patang jam nalika &lt;a href="Janganan"&gt;sayuran&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="K%C3%A8ju"&gt;keju&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="woh"&gt;woh&lt;/a&gt; diolah ing proses sing luwih dawa sing diarani &lt;a href="Pangaseman"&gt;pickling&lt;/a&gt;. Brining padha karo &lt;a href="marinasi"&gt;marinasi&lt;/a&gt;, kajaba marinade biasane kalebu asam sing akeh, kaya ta cuka utawa jus jeruk. Brining uga padha karo &lt;a href="Pangaw%C3%A9tan"&gt;ngobati&lt;/a&gt;, sing biasane umume ngeringake panganan, lan ditindakake sajrone wektu sing luwih suwe.
