Braunschweiger (; dijenengi sawise &lt;a href="Braunschweig"&gt;Braunschweig&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt;) kalebu jinis &lt;a href="sosis"&gt;sosis&lt;/a&gt;. Jinis sosis sing diarani istilah beda-beda miturut wilayah. Ing &lt;a href="basa%20Jerman"&gt;basa Jerman&lt;/a&gt;, Braunschweiger minangka jeneng demoni kanggo wong-wong saka &lt;a href="Braunschweig"&gt;Brunswick&lt;/a&gt; (jeneng Jerman, Braunschweig), nanging miturut ukum panganan Jerman nuduhake macem-macem mettwurst. Ing &lt;a href="Ostenrik"&gt;Ostenrik&lt;/a&gt;, Braunschweiger dikenal minangka jinis sosis parboiled (&lt;a href="Br%C3%BChwurst"&gt;Brühwurst&lt;/a&gt;), dene Braunschweiger Amerika asring bingung karo &lt;a href="liverwurst"&gt;liverwurst&lt;/a&gt;.Braunschweiger Mettwurst minangka sosis &lt;a href="Pangasepan"&gt;asap&lt;/a&gt;, alus lan nyebar biasane digawe saka daging &lt;a href="Daging%20babi"&gt;babi&lt;/a&gt; cincang mentah lan dibumboni bawang putih, uyah lan mrico. Diprodhuksi dening para jagal Brunswick minangka spesialisasi regional wiwit wiwitan abad kaping 19, nyebar dadi akeh kanthi anane &lt;a href="Pangawetan%20panganan"&gt;panganan ing&lt;/a&gt; kaleng. Ana pirang-pirang resep sing beda, ana uga sing kalebu daging sapi lan lemak.
