<doc id="173552" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=173552" title="Babka kenthang">
Babka kenthang

Babka kentang minangka panganan gurih, misuwur utamane ing &lt;a href="B%C3%A9larus"&gt;Bélarus&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Polen"&gt;Polen&lt;/a&gt;, sing diarani babka ziemniaczana. Kang digawe saka grated &lt;a href="Kenthang"&gt;kentang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Endhog%20minangka%20panganan"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bawang%20bombay"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt;, lan bagéyan saka garang, nggodhok utawa goreng &lt;a href="Daging%20bakon"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt; lan (utamané ing Polen) &lt;a href="sosis"&gt;sosis&lt;/a&gt;. Punika open-baking ing crock, lan asring karo saus saka ora nguntungke krim lan daging babi &lt;a href="wiktionary%3Aflitch"&gt;flitch&lt;/a&gt;. Gumantung saka resep lan cara masak, bisa uga kue kentang flaky utawa puding kentang sing abot. &lt;a href="Kugelis"&gt;Piringane padha karo kugelis&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Masakan%20Litowen"&gt;Litowen&lt;/a&gt; lan Kentang Kentang &lt;a href="Olah-olahan%20Yahudi"&gt;Yahudi Ashkenazi&lt;/a&gt;, uga dikenal kanthi jeneng &lt;a href="Kugel"&gt;Kartoffelkugel&lt;/a&gt; ing basa &lt;a href="Basa%20Yiddish"&gt;Yiddish&lt;/a&gt;.
