<doc id="173574" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=173574" title="Barros luco">
Barros luco

Barros Luco minangka &lt;a href="sandwich"&gt;sandwich&lt;/a&gt; panas ing &lt;a href="Cil%C3%A9"&gt;Chili&lt;/a&gt; sing kalebu &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="K%C3%A8ju"&gt;keju&lt;/a&gt; cair ing salah sawijining jinis roti. Sandwich jenenge sawise presiden Chili Ramón Barros Luco, lan digawe ing restoran Kongres Nasional Chili, ngendi presiden Barros Luco mesthi njaluk roti lapis iki. Sumber liyane nuduhake Confitería Torres minangka papan sandwich digawe. Motong daging sing digunakake kanggo sandwich iki padha karo sing digunakake kanggo &lt;a href="churrasco"&gt;churrasco&lt;/a&gt;, sandwich Chili liyane. Sawetara jinis roti digunakake ing sandwich iki: Pan de frica, pan amasado, marraqueta lan roti putih sing wis diiris populer. Sepupu presiden, senator Barros Jarpa njaluk roti lapis karo &lt;a href="ham"&gt;ham&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="K%C3%A8ju"&gt;keju&lt;/a&gt;, mula sandwich kasebut wiwit diarani &lt;a href="Barros%20Jarpa"&gt;Barros Jarpa&lt;/a&gt;. 
