<doc id="173575" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=173575" title="Giardiniera">
Giardiniera

Giardiniera minangka &lt;a href="Bumbu%20sisih"&gt;bumbu&lt;/a&gt; serbaguna sing bisa digunakake kanggo macem-macem panganan, kayata &lt;a href="bratwurst"&gt;bratwurst&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="bruschetta"&gt;bruschetta&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Hamburger"&gt;burger&lt;/a&gt;, salad pasta, &lt;a href="Endhog%20minangka%20panganan"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Omel%C3%A8t"&gt;omelet&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Hot%20dog"&gt;asu panas&lt;/a&gt;, salad tuna, &lt;a href="sandwich"&gt;sandwich&lt;/a&gt;, lan liya-liyane. Ing AS, umume nggunakake giardiniera ing &lt;a href="pasta"&gt;pasta&lt;/a&gt; utawa, ing wilayah Chicago, &lt;a href="pizza"&gt;pizza&lt;/a&gt;. Versi Italia kalebu &lt;a href="Lombok%20lonc%C3%A8ng"&gt;lada mrica&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sl%C3%A8dri"&gt;celery&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="wortel"&gt;wortel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="kembang%20kol"&gt;kembang kol&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="gherkin"&gt;gherkin&lt;/a&gt;. Sayuran asem diasinake nganggo minyak, cuka anggur putih utawa putih, jamu lan rempah-rempah.

