<doc id="173582" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=173582" title="Kuwé shrewsbury">
Kuwé shrewsbury

Kue Shrewsbury utawa biskuit Shrewsbury minangka salah sawijining olahan jinis &lt;a href="panganan%20cuci%20mulut"&gt;panganan cuci mulut&lt;/a&gt; klasik ing Inggris, dijenengi sawise Shrewsbury, kutha kabupaten Shropshire. Iki digawe saka &lt;a href="Adhonan"&gt;adonan&lt;/a&gt; sing ngemot &lt;a href="gula"&gt;gula&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="glepung"&gt;glepung&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Endhog%20minangka%20panganan"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mert%C3%A9ga"&gt;butter&lt;/a&gt; lan semangat lemon ; woh garing uga asring ditambahake. Kue shrewsbury bisa ukuran cilik kanggo disajikake saben-saben, utawa gedhe kanggo dadi panganan cuci mulut.

