<doc id="173594" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=173594" title="Endhog iwak">
Endhog iwak

Roe () utawa roe hard yaiku endhog endhog internal sing wis mateng ing ovary, utawa endhog eksternal sing metu saka &lt;a href="iwak"&gt;iwak&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Sato%20k%C3%A9wan"&gt;kewan&lt;/a&gt; sagara tartamtu, kaya ta udang, scallop, landhes sagara, lan &lt;a href="Juwi"&gt;cumi-cumi&lt;/a&gt;. Minangka &lt;a href="Tetedhan%20seganten"&gt;panganan laut&lt;/a&gt;, roe digunakake minangka bahan sing &lt;a href="Olah-olah"&gt;dimasak&lt;/a&gt; ing pirang-pirang piring lan bahan baku. Roe saka bahan &lt;a href="Sturgeon"&gt;bakar&lt;/a&gt; utawa kadang iwak liyane kaya ta &lt;a href="Mullet%20abu-abu%20Flathead"&gt;mullet abu-abu flathead&lt;/a&gt;, minangka produk dhasar sing digawe saka &lt;a href="kaviar"&gt;kaviar&lt;/a&gt;.

