<doc id="173632" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=173632" title="Piring mangan awan">
Piring mangan awan

Piring mangan awan (basa Hawaiian) minangka panganan khas Hawaii sing kira-kira padha karo meat-lan-telu Amerika Selatan. Nanging, pengaruh pan-Asia ing masakan Hawaii, lan oyot ing bento Jepang, nggawe piring kasebut unik kanggo Hawaii. Kontribusi etnis Asia liyane kalebu &lt;a href="Rafute"&gt;daging babi shoin&lt;/a&gt; Okinawan (Okinawan: rafute), daging babi &lt;a href="Char%20siu"&gt;char siu sing&lt;/a&gt; dipengaruhi China, lan &lt;a href="Adobo%20Pilipina"&gt;adobo&lt;/a&gt; pitik Filipina lan &lt;a href="longanisa"&gt;longanisa&lt;/a&gt;. Masakan Eropa Barat kalebu &lt;a href="lingui%C3%A7a"&gt;linguiça&lt;/a&gt;, sosis tradisional Portugis.

