<doc id="173633" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=173633" title="Relish">
Relish

A relish yaiku salah sawijining &lt;a href="Olah-olah"&gt;masak&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Pangaseman"&gt;pickled&lt;/a&gt; produk digawe saka disigar &lt;a href="Janganan"&gt;sayuran&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Woh"&gt;woh-wohan&lt;/a&gt;, pickles utawa &lt;a href="Herba"&gt;Jamu&lt;/a&gt; lan item pangan biasane digunakake minangka &lt;a href="Bumbu%20sisih"&gt;bumbu&lt;/a&gt; kanggo nambah pokok sing. Contone yaiku chutneys lan rasa ing Amerika Utara, selai timun acar sing dipangan karo &lt;a href="Hot%20dog"&gt;asu panas&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="hamburger"&gt;hamburger&lt;/a&gt;. Ing Amerika Utara, tembung "relish" asring digunakake kanggo njlentrehake macem-macem rasa timun acar sing disigar alus, kaya ta jeruk, dill, lan rasa manis.

