<doc id="173639" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=173639" title="Chow fun daging sapi">
Chow fun daging sapi

Kesenengan daging sapi minangka sajian utama Kanton, digawe saka &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;daging sapi sing&lt;/a&gt; digoreng, &lt;a href="Shahe%20fen"&gt;nyenengake hor&lt;/a&gt; (mi beras amba) lan kecambah Umume ditemokake ing restoran yum cha ing Guangdong, &lt;a href="Hong%20Kong"&gt;Hong Kong&lt;/a&gt;, lan jaban rangkah, uga ing cha chaan tengs. Chow fun, utawa mie hor goreng (&lt;a href="shahe%20fen"&gt;shahe fen&lt;/a&gt;) mie, yaiku sawetara preparat individu sing beda (lan bisa dibandhingake karo macem-macem jinis &lt;a href="pizza"&gt;pizza&lt;/a&gt; ing masakan Amerika Serikat). 
Bahan utama sajian iki yaiku mie &lt;a href="Shahe%20fen"&gt;nyenengake&lt;/a&gt;, sing uga dikenal minangka &lt;a href="shahe%20fen"&gt;shahe fen&lt;/a&gt;, asale saka kutha Shahe ing &lt;a href="Guangzhou"&gt;Guangzhou&lt;/a&gt;. Iki mie jembar, warata sing dipotong dadi bentuk (&lt;a href="qiefen"&gt;qiefen&lt;/a&gt;.) Cara masak masak Hor sing paling umum yaiku sup utawa aduk goreng. Hor nyenengake bisa digoreng garing (digoreng tanpa saos) utawa digoreng (digoreng nganggo saus). 
