<doc id="173640" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=173640" title="Char kway teow">
Char kway teow

Char kway teow (Chinese ; pinyin) minangka sajian &lt;a href="mi"&gt;mi&lt;/a&gt; populer saka Asia Tenggara Maritim, utamane ing &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonesia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Malaysia"&gt;Malaysia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Singapura"&gt;Singapura&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Brun%C3%A9i%20Darussalam"&gt;Brunei&lt;/a&gt;. Ing Hokkien, Char ateges “tumis” lan kway teow nuduhake mi beras sing rata. Sajian kasebut dianggep minangka favorit nasional ing Malaysia lan Singapura. 
Iki digawe saka &lt;a href="Shahe%20fen"&gt;mie beras sing rata&lt;/a&gt; (basa Chinese) utawa &lt;a href="Shahe%20fen"&gt;kway teow&lt;/a&gt; (Chinese ; pinyin) udakara 1 cm utawa (ing sisih lor Malaysia) udakara udakara 0,5 cm, digoreng kanthi panas banget kanthi &lt;a href="Kicap%20peteng"&gt;kecap&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Kicap%20peteng"&gt;peteng peteng&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Lombok%20abang"&gt;lombok&lt;/a&gt;, pirang-pirang &lt;a href="Trasi"&gt;belachan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="udang"&gt;udang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kokang%20getih"&gt;pitik getih&lt;/a&gt; tanpa cangkang, disigar &lt;a href="Kucai"&gt;chives Chinese&lt;/a&gt;, irisan-irisan saka &lt;a href="Sosis%20cina"&gt;sosis Chinese&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bakso%20iwak"&gt;fishcake&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kacang%20buncis"&gt;sprouts kacang&lt;/a&gt;, lan kurang umum karo úa. Char kway teow biasane digoreng ing daging babi, kanthi daging babi daging babi sing &lt;a href="Lemak%20babi"&gt;seger&lt;/a&gt;. Ing Pulau Pinang, Char kway teow umume disajikake ing sepotong &lt;a href="godhong%20gedhang"&gt;godhong gedhang&lt;/a&gt; ing piring, kanggo nambah aroma ing mi. 
