<doc id="173651" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=173651" title="Hokkien mee">
Hokkien mee

Hokkien mee minangka panganan &lt;a href="Asia%20Kidul-w%C3%A9tan"&gt;Asia Tenggara&lt;/a&gt;, populer ing masakan &lt;a href="Masakan%20Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonesia&lt;/a&gt;, Malaysia, &lt;a href="Olahan%20Singapura"&gt;Singapura&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Masakan%20Thailand"&gt;Thailand&lt;/a&gt;, sing asale saka masakan provinsi Fujian (Hokkien) China. Ana telung jinis Hokkien mee sing beda. Varian Singapura kalebu &lt;a href="Mi"&gt;mie endhog&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Mi"&gt;mie&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Soun"&gt;nasi&lt;/a&gt; digoreng nganggo &lt;a href="endhog"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt;, irisan &lt;a href="daging%20babi"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt;, udang lan &lt;a href="Juwi"&gt;cumi-cumi&lt;/a&gt;, lan disajik lan dihias karo sayuran, potongan-potongan &lt;a href="Lemak%20babi"&gt;lard cilik&lt;/a&gt;, saos &lt;a href="Sambel"&gt;sambal&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Jeruk%20limau"&gt;jeruk nipis&lt;/a&gt; (kanggo nambah jus jeruk ing sajian). Ana telung jinis Hokkien mee sing beda-beda, lan saben-saben ana ing endi wae wilayah ing &lt;a href="Singapura"&gt;Singapura&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Malaysia"&gt;Malaysia&lt;/a&gt;. Hae mee secara harfiah tegese "mie udang" ing &lt;a href="Basa%20Hokkien"&gt;Hokkien&lt;/a&gt;.
