<doc id="173653" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=173653" title="Couque de dinant">
Couque de dinant

The Couque de Dinant (&lt;a href="basa%20Inggris"&gt;Inggris&lt;/a&gt;: Cake of Dinant) minangka &lt;a href="biskuit"&gt;biskuit&lt;/a&gt; manis sing angel banget lan asli ing kutha Dinant ing &lt;a href="B%C3%A8lgi"&gt;Bèlgi&lt;/a&gt; kidul ing Wallonia.
Couques digawe mung rong bahan: &lt;a href="glepung"&gt;glepung&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Gandhum"&gt;gandum&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="madu"&gt;madu&lt;/a&gt;, bobote padha, lan ora ana liyane: malah banyu utawa &lt;a href="Khamir"&gt;ragi&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Adhonan"&gt;Adonan&lt;/a&gt; dilebokake ing &lt;a href="Cetakan%20%28masak%20diterapake%29"&gt;cetakan&lt;/a&gt; kayu sing digawe saka kayu saka wit &lt;a href="pir"&gt;pir&lt;/a&gt;, wit &lt;a href="Wong%20Juglans"&gt;kenari&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Fagus%20sylvatica"&gt;wit beech&lt;/a&gt;. Cetakan kasebut duwe macem-macem macem-macem, kalebu kewan, motif kembang, wong utawa malang.

