<doc id="173670" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=173670" title="Susu beras">
Susu beras

Susu &lt;a href="Pantun"&gt;pari minangka&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Susu%20tuwuhan"&gt;susu tanduran sing&lt;/a&gt; digawe saka &lt;a href="Pantun"&gt;beras&lt;/a&gt;. Susu beras Commercial biasane diprodhuksi nggunakake beras coklat lan sirup beras coklat, lan bisa legi nggunakake &lt;a href="gula"&gt;gula&lt;/a&gt; utawa gula gantosipun, lan roso dening úa umum, kayata &lt;a href="Vanila"&gt;vanilla&lt;/a&gt;. Umume dikuatake karo &lt;a href="Prot%C3%A9in"&gt;protein&lt;/a&gt; lan mikronutrien, kayata &lt;a href="Vitamin%20b12"&gt;vitamin B12&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kalsiyum"&gt;kalsium&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Wesi"&gt;zat besi&lt;/a&gt;, utawa &lt;a href="Vitamin%20D"&gt;vitamin D.&lt;/a&gt; 
Dibandhingake karo &lt;a href="Susu"&gt;susu sapi, susu&lt;/a&gt; pari ngemot &lt;a href="karbohidrat"&gt;karbohidrat&lt;/a&gt; luwih akeh (9% vs 5%), nanging ora ngemot &lt;a href="Kalsiyum"&gt;kalsium&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Prot%C3%A9in"&gt;protein sing&lt;/a&gt; signifikan, lan ora ana &lt;a href="kolesterol"&gt;kolesterol&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="laktosa"&gt;laktosa&lt;/a&gt;. Merk komersial susu mung asring dikuatake karo &lt;a href="vitamin"&gt;vitamin&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Mineral%20panganan"&gt;mineral&lt;/a&gt;, kalebu &lt;a href="Kalsiyum"&gt;kalsium&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Cyanocobalamin"&gt;vitamin B 12&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Niacin"&gt;vitamin B 3&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Wesi"&gt;zat besi&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Indeks%20glikemik"&gt;Nduwe indeks glikemik&lt;/a&gt; 86 dibandhingake 37 kanggo &lt;a href="susu%20skim"&gt;susu skim&lt;/a&gt; lan 39 kanggo susu sakabehane. 
Susu beras paling ora &lt;a href="Al%C3%A8rgi"&gt;alergen ing&lt;/a&gt; antarane susu tanduran, lan bisa dikonsumsi dening wong sing ora &lt;a href="Intoleransi%20laktosa"&gt;sabar laktosa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Alergi%20kedele"&gt;alergi marang kedelai&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Alergi%20susu"&gt;susu&lt;/a&gt;. Iki uga digunakake minangka sulih susu dening &lt;a href="Veganisme"&gt;vegan&lt;/a&gt;. 
