<doc id="173681" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=173681" title="Linzer torte">
Linzer torte

Linzer torte minangka jajanan tradisional &lt;a href="Masakan%20Ostenrik"&gt;Ostenrik&lt;/a&gt;, sawijining bentuk shortcake sing diawetake kanggo ngreksa woh-wohan lan irisan kacang kanthi desain kisi ing sisih ndhuwur. Kutha iki dijenengi sawise jeneng kutha &lt;a href="Linz"&gt;Linz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ostenrik"&gt;Ostenrik&lt;/a&gt;.
Linzer torte punika cendhak banget, crumbly jajanan digawe saka glepung, unsalted &lt;a href="Mert%C3%A9ga"&gt;butter&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kuning%20endhog"&gt;endhog yolks&lt;/a&gt;, linglang &lt;a href="Zest%20%28bahan%29"&gt;zest&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kayu%20legi"&gt;kayu manis&lt;/a&gt; lan linglang jus, lan lemah &lt;a href="Kacang%20%28woh%29"&gt;perkakas&lt;/a&gt;, biasane &lt;a href="Kacang%20hazel"&gt;hazelnuts&lt;/a&gt;, nanging malah &lt;a href="walnut"&gt;walnut&lt;/a&gt;s utawa &lt;a href="almond"&gt;almond&lt;/a&gt;s digunakake, dijamin karo Isi saka &lt;a href="redcurrant"&gt;redcurrant&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Raspb%C3%A9ri"&gt;raspberry&lt;/a&gt;, utawa &lt;a href="S%C3%A9l%C3%A9%20woh"&gt;ngreksa&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Apricot"&gt;aprikot&lt;/a&gt;. Ora kaya umume &lt;a href="Torte"&gt;tort&lt;/a&gt;, biasane lapisan tunggal kaya &lt;a href="Pai"&gt;pie&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="tart"&gt;tart&lt;/a&gt;. Ditutupi lattice saka strip adonan lancip sing dilebokake ing ndhuwur woh-wohan. Kue kue disapu nganggo endhog putih sing diantemi entheng, dipanggang lan dihiasi nganggo perkakas.
Linzer torte minangka perawatan liburan ing tradhisi Ostenrik, Honggari, Switserlan, Jerman, lan Tirolean, sing asring dipangan nalika Natal. Sawetara toko roti Amerika Utara nawakake tzer Linzer minangka tart cilik utawa cookie

