Kulit jeruk

Zest iku bahan pangan sing wis disiapake dening scraping utawa nglereni saka rind unwaxed &lt;a href="Sitrus"&gt;woh-wohan jeuk&lt;/a&gt; kaya ta &lt;a href="L%C3%A9mon"&gt;linglang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jeruk"&gt;oranye&lt;/a&gt;, citron, lan &lt;a href="Jeruk%20limau"&gt;jeruk&lt;/a&gt;. Zest digunakake kanggo nambah rasa ing panganan.
