<doc id="173734" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=173734" title="Malt">
Malt

Malt &lt;a href="S%C3%A9r%C3%A9alia"&gt;ditanduri&lt;/a&gt; gandum &lt;a href="S%C3%A9r%C3%A9alia"&gt;séréal&lt;/a&gt; sing wis garing ing proses sing dikenal kanthi jeneng " malting ". Gandum kasebut digawe &lt;a href="Thukul"&gt;germin&lt;/a&gt; kanthi direndhem ing banyu banjur diendhegake maneh saka germinasi kanthi garing kanthi hawa panas. Gandum malting ngasilake &lt;a href="%C3%88nzim"&gt;enzim&lt;/a&gt; (α-amylase, β-amylase) sing dibutuhake kanggo ngowahi &lt;a href="Pathi"&gt;pati&lt;/a&gt; gandum dadi macem-macem jinis &lt;a href="gula"&gt;gula&lt;/a&gt;, kalebu &lt;a href="glukosa"&gt;glukosa&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="monosakarida"&gt;monosakarida&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="maltosa"&gt;maltosa&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="disakarida"&gt;disakarida&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="maltotriose"&gt;maltotriose&lt;/a&gt; trisakarida, lan gula sing luwih dhuwur sing diarani &lt;a href="Maltodextrin"&gt;maltodextrines&lt;/a&gt;. Iki uga ngasilake &lt;a href="%C3%88nzim"&gt;enzim&lt;/a&gt; liyane, kayata &lt;a href="protease"&gt;protease&lt;/a&gt;, sing nyuda &lt;a href="Prot%C3%A9in"&gt;protein&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="gandum"&gt;gandum&lt;/a&gt; dadi bentuk sing bisa digunakake &lt;a href="Khamir"&gt;ragi&lt;/a&gt;. Titik proses malting dihentikan nyebabake rasio &lt;a href="Pathi"&gt;pati&lt;/a&gt; - karo enzim lan pati sebagian dikonversi dadi gula sing difermentasi.
