<doc id="173750" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=173750" title="Romesco">
Romesco

Romesco (Catalan pronunciation: [rumɛsku]) punika basis tomat &lt;a href="Saos"&gt;sauce&lt;/a&gt; sing asalé saka Valls, Tarragona, &lt;a href="Catalunya"&gt;Catalonia&lt;/a&gt;. Para nelayan ing wilayah kasebut nggawe saos iki kanggo dipangan karo iwak. Biasane digawe saka campuran &lt;a href="tomat"&gt;tomat&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Bawang"&gt;papak&lt;/a&gt; panggang, &lt;a href="Kacang%20pinus"&gt;kacang&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="almond"&gt;almond&lt;/a&gt; panggang, &lt;a href="kacang%20pinus"&gt;kacang pinus&lt;/a&gt;, lan / utawa &lt;a href="Kacang%20hazel"&gt;kemiri&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Lenga%20ja%C3%A9tun"&gt;minyak zaitun&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Lenga%20kembang%20sreng%C3%A9ng%C3%A9"&gt;kembang srengenge&lt;/a&gt;, lan mrica nyora (srengenge &lt;a href="Lombok%20lonc%C3%A8ng"&gt;mrica&lt;/a&gt; abang, cilik lan bunder sing dibunderake). &lt;a href="Roti"&gt;Roti&lt;/a&gt; basi &lt;a href="Glepung"&gt;gandum&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Roti"&gt;gandum&lt;/a&gt; bisa digunakake kanggo dadi luwih kenthel utawa kanggo menehi tekstur. Úga umum kalebu cuka sadonya, anggur abang &lt;a href="cuka"&gt;cuka&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Bawang%20bombay"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt;. Godhong &lt;a href="adas"&gt;adas&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Godhong%20Mint"&gt;mint&lt;/a&gt; bisa ditambahake, luwih-luwih yen disedhiyakake karo &lt;a href="Iwak%20%28panganan%29"&gt;iwak&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="escargot"&gt;escargot&lt;/a&gt;. Asring banget disajikake karo &lt;a href="Tetedhan%20seganten"&gt;panganan sagara&lt;/a&gt;, nanging bisa uga disedhiyakake kanthi macem-macem panganan liyane, kalebu &lt;a href="unggas"&gt;unggas&lt;/a&gt;, sawetara daging abang kaya &lt;a href="Daging%20domba"&gt;wedhus&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Janganan"&gt;sayuran&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Referensi</h2>

